    IDS_OOBE_APPS_NOSPACE_TEXT "They need about %lu MB, and drive C: has %I64u MB free. Clear some boxes to continue. To install them later, expand drive C: with lntexpandstorage in Command Prompt, then run %%SystemRoot%%\\system32\\oobe\\oobe.exe /components."
