    IDS_UPGRADE_EARLIER "an earlier LiberNT build"
    IDS_UPGRADE_NOTE "Upgrade replaces the LiberNT system files with this version and keeps your files, the apps you installed, the user accounts and the settings.\n\nThis version: %s"
    IDS_UPGRADE_HIBERNATED "LiberNT on %s is hibernated, so it cannot be upgraded safely. Start it, shut it down fully, then start Setup again."
    IDS_UPGRADE_READYTITLE "Ready to upgrade"
    IDS_UPGRADE_READYSUBTITLE "Review your choice. Setup starts upgrading LiberNT when you click Upgrade."
    IDS_UPGRADEBTN "&Upgrade"
    IDS_READY_UPGRADE "LiberNT on %s is upgraded from %s to %s."
    IDS_READY_UPGRADE_KEEP "Your files, apps, user accounts and settings are kept. The LiberNT system files, the registry entries of the system and the bootloader are replaced. No partition is created, deleted or formatted."
    IDS_UPGRADE_PROCESSTITLE "Upgrading LiberNT"
    IDS_UPGRADE_PROCESSSUBTITLE "Setup replaces the system files, updates the registry and installs the bootloader. Your files, apps and settings are kept. This can take a few minutes."
    IDS_UPGRADE_DONETITLE "LiberNT is upgraded"
END

